Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滑菇光滑好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.13,0:15:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,番薯熱騰騰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蘋果脆脆嚼嚼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:32.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蘋果清脆香甜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:33.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:35.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}cut
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊出村真...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}cut
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這點蘋果給我嚥下去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.99,0:15:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我看看妳吃苦的毅力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吃的又不是苦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊出村真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}cut
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 {\fn华康少女字体\fs50}OK{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 沒有我出場的份嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不滿足啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.47,0:16:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那這樣拍攝就結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:19.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「衝擊力不夠」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「想拍個更刺激 更有爆炸性的廣告」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...我們是照導演畫的分鏡拍的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.44,0:16:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「影片是活的」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「臨時改變是理所當然的」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:36.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今你這麼說 都已經拍完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.19,0:16:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼...加入歌怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歌?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我 作了熊出村的印象曲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家唱的歌在廣告播的話會很有趣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:52.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家是有包括我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊熊熊熊　熊出村 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是個大家都帶著笑容的歡樂村子 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.07,0:17:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「就是這個」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「這才是熊出村的熱情」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:07.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來唱吧 來唱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:08.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.57,0:17:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要拍是可以 已經快沒時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.73,0:17:14.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那大家馬上練習
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.24,0:17:18.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,30分後拍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒時間了 不能NG喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.19,0:17:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽清楚了吧 大家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊出村是個好地方 {\fn华康少女字体\fs50}Take1
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對 一次決勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.60,0:17:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.23,0:17:36.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:35.86,Remark,NTP,0,0,0,,真冬: 老爺子您還沒玩夠嗎…？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:40.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊熊熊熊　熊出村 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:42.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊出村的名產是 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滑菇光滑好吃 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.22,0:17:45.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,番薯熱騰騰 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蘋果清脆香甜 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也別忘了我的濁酒 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.13,0:17:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊熊熊熊　熊出村 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:54.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更加厲害的名產是 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,村裡的偶像 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:00.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有精神又可愛的巫女和 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:03.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愉快又歡樂的村民 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.49,0:18:04.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快來吧 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.71,0:18:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快來吧 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.03,0:18:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快來吧　快來吧 熊出村 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.35,0:18:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}cut
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.78,0:18:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,導演
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}一次就完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.83,0:18:36.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之是結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:49.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}咦 你還在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為明天要交給電視局
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:54.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在編輯中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:18:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊 我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有清楚拍到我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.85,0:19:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能看啦 還沒有完成
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.26,0:19:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼關係 真小氣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:05.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.82,0:19:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 等播放時再看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:11.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見 別太操勞了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.16,0:19:13.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡開始才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:20.97,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,熊出村的名產是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.23,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,滑菇光滑好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:23.60,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,番薯熱騰騰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:24.83,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,蘋果清脆香甜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:27.24,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,也別忘了我的濁酒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來是11點發表的東北地方的天氣預報
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臼井爺爺穿禮服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是初次當導演的作品啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:45.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦 我緊張到看不了電視了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.55,0:19:48.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 30秒一下子就過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就快播了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.41,0:19:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,4 3 2 1
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:59.91,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}くくくく　熊出村
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:59.91,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}熊熊熊熊　熊出村
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.13,0:20:02.56,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}熊出村の名物は
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.13,0:20:02.56,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}熊出村的名產是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:04.00,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}なめこぬめぬめ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:04.00,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}滑菇光滑好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.07,0:20:05.36,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}お芋ほくほく
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.07,0:20:05.36,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}番薯熱騰騰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.40,0:20:06.65,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}りんごしゃきしゃき
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.40,0:20:06.65,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}蘋果清脆香甜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.63,0:20:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs30\pos(716,662)}マチ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.63,0:20:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也別忘了德山真知子 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.63,0:20:08.47,Remark,NTP,0,0,0,,※ 德山真知子 的「真知」二字，音同「小町」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我被剪掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.58,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}くくくく　熊出村
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.58,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}熊熊熊熊　熊出村
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:14.41,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}もっとすごい名物は
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.76,0:20:14.41,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}更加厲害的名產是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,村裡的偶像 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.27,0:20:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs30\pos(756,662)}マチ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有精神又可愛的小真知和 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.89,0:20:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愉快又歡樂的奶奶 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.31,0:20:24.39,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}おいでよ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.31,0:20:24.39,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}快來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.56,0:20:25.61,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}おいでよ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.56,0:20:25.61,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}快來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:29.65,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}おいでよ　おいでよ　熊出村
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:29.65,IN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}快來吧　快來吧 熊出村
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…的德山鐘錶眼鏡店 ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午間新聞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.66,0:20:42.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}昨天從山王第三小學的後庭的雞籠逃出來而失蹤的雞 庭子和鳥太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}今早...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:48.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀 30秒真是一下子就過去了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 良夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.85,0:20:54.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這哪裡是熊出村的廣告了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.81,0:20:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:21:01.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德山的婆婆提出的條件是要把店的宣傳和孫子的歌當主題
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.02,0:21:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣不就是德山鐘錶店的廣告了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.15,0:21:06.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不錯喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.65,0:21:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然被剪掉了 我有聽到我的歌聲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上電視的感覺真奇妙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.45,0:21:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然只有一點點 有拍到我真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.09,0:21:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,廣告萬歲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:21.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬歲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這能為村莊宣傳嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.32,0:21:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這誰知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過大家都很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是很好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:40.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這..這...這才...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是老夫的作品
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.31,0:21:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說話了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.32,0:21:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.46,0:22:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}臼井爺爺又昏倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}救護車救護車
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.10,0:22:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}電話電話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.63,0:22:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}啊 沒訊號
