Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.93,0:23:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 {\fn华康少女字体\fs50}OK
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.15,0:23:45.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過再來一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.16,0:23:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家會生氣吧
