Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.59,0:23:31.95,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}めっちゃHappy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.03,0:23:34.73,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}エービーバディバディ みんなHappy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.85,0:23:36.20,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}はい 就寝
