Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.66,0:22:16.20,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}跑吧跑吧 快點逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.36,0:22:19.68,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女小姐 巫女小姐 快點逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.71,0:22:22.11,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}反正你會跟上來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.19,0:22:25.31,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}熊先生 熊先生 我都看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.33,0:22:28.07,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}果然被發現了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.35,0:22:30.96,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}畢竟我們
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.23,0:22:34.04,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}一直都在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.23,0:22:36.69,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}la se！la se la se la─
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.77,0:22:39.98,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}沒有信號 傳不到這
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:42.46,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}Wi-Fi 雖然是有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.52,0:22:45.81,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}便利商店 都不是便利商店了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.87,0:22:48.32,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}因為是鄉下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:54.27,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}太陽落山 夜幕降臨 山中小徑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.32,0:22:57.47,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}1 2 3 4 DJ here we go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.50,0:22:59.92,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}OK 村民 check it out！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.97,0:23:02.90,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女小姐 巫女小姐 熊出村的巫女小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.93,0:23:05.77,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好可愛 好可愛 還說沒有這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:08.69,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}哥哥也好 姐姐也好 都是滑菇妖怪 怪怪怪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.75,0:23:10.19,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}沒錯 沒錯 沒錯 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.22,0:23:11.63,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}就是熊巫女之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.67,0:23:14.52,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}反正是熊巫女 DANCING
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.57,0:23:17.40,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不跳的話 村 村 村民
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.45,0:23:20.29,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}明天也在這個村子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.35,0:23:24.55,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}無論如何 都是Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.68,0:23:27.48,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}果然還是Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.59,0:23:31.95,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}超級Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.03,0:23:34.73,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}everybody body 大家Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.85,0:23:36.20,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好 就寢
