Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:31.12,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}梳妝打扮可不能偷工減料
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:32.87,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不行不行，怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.03,0:02:34.60,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}抓住{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}cute　心跳Magic！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.76,0:02:36.27,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}這件連身裙，很適合我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.47,0:02:38.17,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不快點不行，已經這時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:39.92,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好，我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:45.19,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}原諒我吧　我也總有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:48.06,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}會長大成人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:54.21,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}但你還要待在我身邊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:58.86,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}因為　因為　很可怕嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.06,0:03:02.42,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}微微一笑　很困擾嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:05.32,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}在你那大大的手臂之中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:09.51,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我想一直撒嬌下去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:12.86,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}等等我　好好地　回應我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:15.50,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}別裝作沒聽到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:21.62,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}即使魔法消失
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:23.84,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}緊緊　緊緊擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:27.20,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:30.77,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}摸摸　摸摸我的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:34.40,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多摸摸我的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
